WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.219
Find the risk tool.

2
00:00:01.339 --> 00:00:03.475
Open Tools and select Risk.

3
00:00:03.595 --> 00:00:08.239
The risk calculator shares its practice budget with the position size calculator.

4
00:00:09.291 --> 00:00:10.673
Adjust the percentage.

5
00:00:10.793 --> 00:00:15.762
Move the risk slider from one percent to two percent and watch the dollar risk budget change.

6
00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:19.074
This does not guarantee an executed stop price.

7
00:00:20.095 --> 00:00:21.825
Compare position size.

8
00:00:21.945 --> 00:00:26.368
Return to Position size and read the updated risk setting and share estimate.

9
00:00:26.488 --> 00:00:29.135
Revisit the assumptions before a practice order.

